    "result_text": "The full test suite is green (2/2 passing, BUILD SUCCESS). There's a single test class, `AcceptanceTest`, and both scenarios pass.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the `contactPreference` derived field on owners, following the repo's existing OpenAPI-generated-DTO + MapStruct-mapper convention:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` string property to the `Owner` schema, alongside the other derived fields (`displayName`, `initials`, `locality`), so the generated `OwnerDto` exposes it in the JSON response.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` targeting `contactPreference` backed by a helper method that returns `\"EMAIL\"` when the owner has a non-blank email, otherwise `\"PHONE\"` (mirroring the email-presence check already used by `membershipLevel`).\n\nBoth acceptance tests \u2014 `corePhoneWhenNoEmail` (expects `PHONE`) and `functionalityEmailWhenPresent` (expects `EMAIL`) \u2014 pass.",
